# DRAW keymap preset: Procreate  (SAFEST — only DRAW-free target keys remapped)
#
# Format: actionId keycode requireMods forbidMods [device button]
#   mods bits: 1=Ctrl 2=Shift 4=Alt.  Action ids: GUI/COMMAND.BM (CMD_init) / SHORTCUTS.md.
# Policy (Rick, "safest"): applied ONLY if the target key is UNBOUND in DRAW.
#
# Procreate is a TOUCH-first iPad app — it has almost no standard hardware-keyboard
# shortcuts, and its core interactions (two-finger undo, QuickShape, ColorDrop) are
# gestures, not keys. This preset is informational; DRAW's own defaults are kept.

# --- Safe remaps (target key free in DRAW) ---
# (none — Procreate has no keyboard convention to mirror)

# --- Notes (gestures, not bindable keys) -------------------------------------
#   Two-finger tap   Undo        -> DRAW Ctrl+Z (or bind a mouse button via Customize Controls)
#   Three-finger tap Redo        -> DRAW Ctrl+Y
#   ColorDrop (drag) Fill        -> DRAW Fill (F) or R-Click with BG
#   QuickShape       Smart shape -> DRAW Smart Shapes (S)
#   TIP: Procreate users may prefer binding Undo/Redo to mouse BACK/FORWARD buttons —
#        which DRAW already does by default (see the MOUSE category in Customize Controls).
